' A production's tool on a right click (`preset classic ai none seed 3 start
' 30 party give item_rat_trap,item_rat_trap`: a prepared state, the
' companion camped at Paradise Camp and two rat traps given). v1.2's
' `OnRightClickItemRoom` (InventoryScene.cs:778-795): a trap on the room's
' floor selects its production for the place, when the place has it
' (`SelectProduction`: the player's choice; its dialog only with the hints
' hidden): "now making: rats", and the save's camp line says `manual`.
' `OnRightClickItemInventory` (:727-730): the same trap in the pack does
' nothing. Neither asks the builder. Before, both opened the construction
' conversation.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
join                     ' camped here: the place is ours
wait 10
mapclick 177,150         ' the tent
wait 200
uiclick 168,248          ' a rat trap put down
wait 5
uiclick r168,248         ' the other, in the pack: nothing
wait 5
snap trap_in_pack
press right              ' the floor's first item lit: the maggots
press right              ' the next: the trap
press f                  ' its right click: rats, by choice
wait 5
snap trap_selected
esc
wait 10
save
quit
